{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CapitalAccounts\">Capital Accounts</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts And Business By CapitalAccount CapitalAccounts Count FundsContributed Is On Partners To ToDate\">The <strong>Capital Accounts</strong> tab tracks funds contributed by and distributed to business owners or partners.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts And CapitalAccount CapitalAccounts Count Drawings Investment Investments On Profit ShareOfProfit To ToDate\">Use capital accounts to monitor owner investments, drawings, and their share of profits or losses.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-chart text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CapitalAccounts\">Capital Accounts</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts CapitalAccount CapitalAccounts Count\">Creating Capital Accounts</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account CapitalAccount Count Create NewCapitalAccount On To ToDate\">Click the <strong>New Capital Account</strong> button to create an account for each owner or partner.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg flex gap-4 shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CapitalAccounts\">Capital Accounts</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewCapitalAccount\">New Capital Account</span></span></div></div><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account CapitalAccount Count\">Learn about capital account setup:</span> <a href=\"/guides/capital-account-form\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CapitalAccount\">Capital Account</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Edit\">Edit</span></a></p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Balance StartingBalance StartingBalances\">Setting Starting Balances</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Balance CapitalAccount CapitalAccounts Count Current CurrentBalance Is On Rent Settings StartingBalance StartingBalances\">For existing capital accounts with current balances, set starting balances in <strong>Settings</strong> → <strong>Starting Balances</strong>.</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Balance StartingBalance StartingBalances\">Learn about starting balances:</span> <a href=\"/guides/capital-account-starting-balance-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CapitalAccounts\">Capital Accounts</span></a></p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Column Columns\">Understanding the Columns</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts CapitalAccount CapitalAccounts Count Is On\">The <strong>Capital Accounts</strong> tab displays the following information:</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Code\">Code</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Code\">Code</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account CapitalAccount Code Column Count Is On\">The <strong>Code</strong> column displays the code for the capital account.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account CapitalAccount Column Count Is Name On\">The <strong>Name</strong> column displays the name of the capital account.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ControlAccount\">Control account</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ControlAccount\">Control account</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Balance BalanceSheet CapitalAccount Column ControlAccount Count HasWhere Is On\">The <strong>Control Account</strong> column shows where this capital account appears on the <strong>Balance Sheet</strong>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts CapitalAccount CapitalAccounts ControlAccount ControlAccounts Count Create Custom Is Less On To ToDate\">The default is <em>Capital Accounts</em> unless you've created custom control accounts.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Division\">Division</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Division\">Division</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account CapitalAccount Column Count Division Is On Port To ToDate\">The <strong>Division</strong> column shows the division assigned to this capital account for divisional reporting.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Balance\">Balance</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Balance\">Balance</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Balance CapitalAccount Column Count Current CurrentBalance On Rent\">The <strong>Balance</strong> column shows the current balance of each capital account.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Amount Balance Is On To ToDate Transaction Transactions View\">Click the balance amount to view all transactions that make up this balance.</p></div></details><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Columns Custom Customize Edit EditColumns Is On To ToDate\">Click <strong>Edit Columns</strong> to customize which columns are visible.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pb-4 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 p-3 border-b\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"border text-xs rounded py-1 px-2 bg-white border-neutral-300 text-neutral-400\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"EditColumns\">Edit columns</span></span></div></div></div><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Custom On To ToDate\">Learn about column customization:</span> <a href=\"/guides/edit-columns\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"EditColumns\">Edit columns</span></a></p>",
  "key": "capital-accounts"
}
